---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About Attirel — Built to Solve the Online Sizing Problem"
  description="Attirel was built to end wrong-size online orders: your measurements once, an AI-powered fit score on every product, across all your favourite stores."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-article px-5 py-16">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight md:text-5xl">
      About Attirel
    </h1>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/85">
      <p>
        Attirel started with a familiar frustration: three tabs open, three size charts, and
        three different answers about what size to order. Online shopping gave us every store
        in the world and took away the one thing that made buying clothes work — knowing
        whether something fits before you pay for it.
      </p>
      <p>
        We built Attirel to close that gap. You take your measurements once, guided
        step-by-step (with audio, if you like). From then on, every product you browse gets an
        AI-powered fit score matched to your actual body — adjusted for how each brand runs,
        the garment's cut and stretch, and your feedback on how past purchases really fit.
      </p>
      <p>
        The goal is simple: make "will it fit?" a question software answers, so you can get
        back to the fun part — deciding what you love.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="mt-14 font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">What we believe</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-lg text-ink/85">
      <li>Your body is never the problem — the label is.</li>
      <li>Fit recommendations should be based on measurements, not marketing.</li>
      <li>When our confidence is low, we say so instead of letting you guess.</li>
      <li>Fewer returns are better for you, for retailers, and for the planet.</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="mt-10 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/85">
      Attirel is built and operated by Kelt IV Labs LLC, a company based in New Jersey, USA.
    </p>

    <section id="affiliate-disclosure" class="mt-14 rounded-2xl border-2 border-plum/30 bg-plum-light p-7">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-plum">Affiliate disclosure</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-ink/85">
        Attirel participates in affiliate marketing programs. We may earn a commission when you
        purchase through links on this site or in our app, at no additional cost to you. This
        never affects which products we recommend — our fit scores are based purely on your
        measurements.
      </p>
    </section>

    <div class="mt-12 rounded-3xl bg-plum px-8 py-12 text-center text-white">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold">Come shop like it's tailored.</h2>
      <a
        href="https://attirel.ai"
        class="mt-6 inline-block rounded-full bg-white px-8 py-3 font-semibold text-plum transition-opacity hover:opacity-90"
      >
        Try Attirel at attirel.ai →
      </a>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
